    "text": "SPEED & TIMING\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 9, CC 49 to 60\n   1 Clip speed\n   2 Reverse and replay\n   3 Freeze frame\n   4 Jump cuts\n   5 Cutting to the beat\n   6 Pace across the scene\n   7 suite: Viral edit\n   8 suite: Music video\n   9 suite: Trailer\n  10 pair: When the music is featured, the cuts find the beat\n  11 pair: When jump cuts go rhythmic, a joke builds\n  12 pairs: Music leads the edit"
